<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-16749] .NET: EntryPointNotFoundException on Alpine Linux</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-16749</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Ignite.NET does not start on Alpine Linux:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
Unhandled exception. &lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;System&lt;/span&gt;.EntryPointNotFoundException: Unable to find an entry point named &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&apos;dlopen&apos;&lt;/span&gt; in shared library &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&apos;libcoreclr.so&apos;&lt;/span&gt;.
   at Apache.Ignite.Core.Impl.Unmanaged.Jni.DllLoader.NativeMethodsCore.dlopen(&lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;String&lt;/span&gt; filename, Int32 flags)
   at Apache.Ignite.Core.Impl.Unmanaged.Jni.DllLoader.Load(&lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;String&lt;/span&gt; dllPath)
   at Apache.Ignite.Core.Impl.Unmanaged.Jni.JvmDll.LoadDll(&lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;String&lt;/span&gt; filePath, &lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;String&lt;/span&gt; simpleName)
   at Apache.Ignite.Core.Impl.Unmanaged.Jni.JvmDll.Load(&lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;String&lt;/span&gt; configJvmDllPath, ILogger log)
   at Apache.Ignite.Core.Ignition.Start(IgniteConfiguration cfg)
   at Apache.Ignite.Core.Ignition.Start()
   at Apache.Ignite.Docker.Program.Main() in /app/Program.cs:line 15
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;See &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ptupitsyn/ignite-net-docker/tree/alpine-test&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/ptupitsyn/ignite-net-docker/tree/alpine-test&lt;/a&gt; to reproduce with Docker.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
